			"notes": "Download `NoLostPets-fabric-<Minecraft version>.jar` for your exact game version. Install only one NoLostPets JAR.\n\n**Supported versions**\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.8, 1.21.9, 1.21.10, 1.21.11, 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3.\n- All nine JARs are available below under **Assets**.\n\n**Changes**\n\n- Added support for Minecraft 26.1 through 26.3.\n- Fixed automatic recall stopping after the first batch. The queue now continues without another jump or movement.\n- Fixed recall during jumps. The queue pauses in the air and resumes after landing.\n- Fixed retries when source chunks fail to load. A failed batch no longer stops the remaining queue.\n- Added pets that unload while automatic recall is active to the recall queue.\n- Reworked recall from unloaded chunks to use Minecraft chunk loading and the existing pet entity.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.8–1.21.11: Java 21 or later, Fabric Loader 0.18.2 or later, and Fabric API for your game version.\n- Minecraft 26.1–26.3: Java 25 or later, Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or later, and Fabric API for your game version.\n- Install the matching NoLostPets JAR in the `mods` folder.\n\n**Checks**\n\n- All nine builds passed unit tests and in-game recall tests.\n- All nine production JARs passed client startup, world entry, world save, and clean shutdown checks.\n- Saved-world upgrade checks passed all 312 stages, including interrupted recall and restart recovery.\n\n\n**Source code**\n\n- [Minecraft 1.21.8–1.21.11](https://github.com/KristopherZlo/No-Lost-Pets/tree/93e3c85d1728289829545e346dac882ff9e681af) (NoLostPets 1.1.2).\n- [Minecraft 26.1–26.3](https://github.com/KristopherZlo/No-Lost-Pets/tree/614d731fd9b9ac87495125fa8b525675d120c265) (NoLostPets 1.2.0)."
		},
